     * Group 0:
     *   A = | 1.0 | 2.0 | 5.0 | 6.0 |
     *       | 3.0 | 4.0 | 7.0 | 8.0 |
     *
     *   B = | 5.0 | 6.0 |  9.0 | 10.0 |
